  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">공부에 대한 짧은 생각</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(1) -</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">공부</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">란 무엇인가</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">내가 미국에 와서 해 보는 여러 생각들 가운데 하나이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">내가 생각하기에 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">공부</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">는 수업시간에 배울 내용을 미리 공부하고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학교에서 선생님이 내 준 숙제를 성실하게 하며</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">또 수업시간에 이해가 되지 않았던 부분들에 대해 스스로 배우고 익히는 과정</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이것이 공부가 아닐까 싶다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그리고 이런 관점에서 보면</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">나는 지금까지 공부를 해 본 적이 없다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">예습과 복습을 안했던 것은 물론이고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">숙제조차도 내 손으로 해 간적이 없다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이런 면에서는 역사가 정말 길어서 초등학교 때는 전과를</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">중학교 때는 완전정복을</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">고등학교 때는 자습서를</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">대학교 때는 친구의 리포트를 베꼈다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">나는 숙제가 가장 쉬웠다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">나는 선생님들이 숙제를 왜 내주는지 이해할 수 없었다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">글씨 연습을 하라는 것인가</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그래서 나는 교사가 된 이후로 학생들에게 숙제를 내 준 경우가 거의 없다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그렇다면 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">“</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">네가 지금까지 도서관에 다니면서 하던 것은 뭐였니</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?”</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">라고 물을 수 있을 것이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그건 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시험준비</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&gt;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">였다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그런 면에서도 또한 역사가 길다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">중</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">때는 연합고사</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">고등학교 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년 동안 학력고사</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">대학이후에는 임용고사와 대학원 입학고사</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">교사가 된 이후에는 텝스시험</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그 다음에는 토플시험</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시험을 준비하며 살아온 세월이 어림잡아 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">30</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그리고 나는 그 세월동안 내가 하는 것이 공부라고 믿으며 살았다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">철학과 학생이 서양철학사 대신 일반상식책을 보는 것이 공부인가</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">영문과 학생이 셰익스피어를 읽지 않고 외무고시를 준비하는 것이 공부인가</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">우리나라 대학생들이 준비하는 각종 고시와 언론사 시험</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">기업 입사시험</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">공무원시험</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이런 것을 준비하는 것이 다 공부인가</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">더욱 가관인 것은 학생들의 그런 행동을 독려하겠다고 책이나 자료는 단 한권도 없이 그냥 책상과 의자만 있는</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">열람실이라는 이름의 희한한 시설이 존재한다는 것이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">나는 우리나라의 대학도서관에서 시험을 준비하는 애들을 빼고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">정말 예습과 과제와 복습을 하는 애들만 남기면 그 수가 얼마나 될지 정말로 궁금하다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">나는 미국에 와서 비로소 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">“</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">공부</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">”</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">라는 것을 한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">나는 특별한 일이 없는 한 아침을 먹고 나면 스쿨버스를 타고 학교에 가고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">버스에서 내려서 향하는 곳은 늘 도서관이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">나는 그곳에서 전날에 배운 내용을 복습하고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">선생님이 내준 숙제를 하며</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">다음 시간에 배울 내용을 미리 살펴본다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그러다가 주말이 되면 가족들과 시간을 보내던가 아니면 집에서 밀린 공부를 한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">나는 지금까지 크리스마스이브</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">크리스마스 당일</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">설 전날</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">설 당일</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">추석 전날</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">추석 당일</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이런 날에 도서관에서 시험을 준비한 적이 있으며</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">나는 그것을 공부라고 믿었으며</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">나는 내 스스로가 공부를 참 열심히 하는 학생이라고 생각했다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그러나 지금 생각해 보면</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그것은 우선 공부가 아니었고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그런 내 모습은 열심히 하는 것이 아니라 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이상한</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’ </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">것이었다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">가족과 함께 즐거운 시간을 보내야 할 시간에 도서관에 앉아있다면</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, <span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그게 정상적인 삶인가</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">미국 사람들은 단지 공부만 잘하는 학생들을 그다지 높이 평가하지 않으며</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시회분위기가 그래서인지 모르겠으나 대학에서도 그런 학생을 우수하다고 판단하여 선발하지는 않는다고 한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">공부도 좋지만 동료들로부터 얼마나 인정받는 존재인지가 그 사람을 평가하는 대단히 중요한 요소라고 한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">우리는 우리들 스스로가 얼마나 비정상적이고 이상한 것에 익숙해져 있는지를 스스로 돌아봐야 한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
